WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.634 --> 00:00:04.000
-Lindsay Lohan and I are about
to face off in a water war.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:06.734
We'll play the card game War,
but if you lose the hand,

00:00:06.734 --> 00:00:08.767
you get a pint of water
in the face.

00:00:08.767 --> 00:00:09.901
[ Audience "Ohhs" ]

00:00:09.901 --> 00:00:12.801
The first person
to throw five glasses wins,

00:00:12.801 --> 00:00:16.267
and gets to water-cannon
the loser.

00:00:16.267 --> 00:00:18.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:18.100 --> 00:00:19.267
-Yay!
[ Chuckles ]

00:00:19.267 --> 00:00:22.400
-Lots of ways to get wet,
but only one way to win.

00:00:22.400 --> 00:00:24.133
Lindsay, are you ready for this?

00:00:24.133 --> 00:00:25.567
And we did not rig all of this.

00:00:25.567 --> 00:00:28.300
-Never been more ready, Jimmy.
-I'm apologizing in advance.

00:00:28.300 --> 00:00:30.200
-Okay, I just want to kind of
start 'cause I'm nervous.

00:00:30.200 --> 00:00:34.501
-All right,
one, two, three, flip.

00:00:34.501 --> 00:00:36.667
-Yes!

00:00:36.667 --> 00:00:38.200
Merry Christmas to all!

00:00:38.200 --> 00:00:39.834
-What are you talking about,
"Merry Christmas to all"?!

00:00:39.834 --> 00:00:41.334
-Early!
-All right.

00:00:41.334 --> 00:00:43.534
You get the first card.
Go.

00:00:43.534 --> 00:00:46.567
Oh, my gosh.
You're having too much fun.

00:00:46.567 --> 00:00:48.367
-Oh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:48.367 --> 00:00:49.501
-Wow.

00:00:49.501 --> 00:00:52.634
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:52.634 --> 00:00:54.367
-Didn't hold back
on that one at all.

00:00:54.367 --> 00:00:55.968
That one actually --
-Sorry.

00:00:55.968 --> 00:00:58.367
-Oh, get ready.
No, no, we're ready to play.

00:00:58.367 --> 00:00:59.701
Let's go.
Let's do this.

00:00:59.701 --> 00:01:00.868
All right.
[ Laughter ]

00:01:00.868 --> 00:01:04.033
One, two, three, flip.

00:01:04.033 --> 00:01:05.501
What?!

00:01:05.501 --> 00:01:07.801
What's going on?!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:07.801 --> 00:01:09.033
Maybe I should
move the deck around.

00:01:09.033 --> 00:01:10.734
-Okay. I'll go gentle.
I'll go gentle.

00:01:10.734 --> 00:01:12.667
-Yeah, you will?
No, it's all right.

00:01:12.667 --> 00:01:14.467
-Here.
-That's all right.

00:01:14.467 --> 00:01:15.834
Go for it if you're gonna do it.
You can go for it.

00:01:15.834 --> 00:01:17.868
-No, I did it already.
-Okay. Oh, my --

00:01:17.868 --> 00:01:19.467
You're being too nice
so I'm really gonna go for it.

00:01:19.467 --> 00:01:21.501
All right.
-Oh, shoot.

00:01:21.501 --> 00:01:23.634
-Do I trust this,
or should I switch hands?

00:01:23.634 --> 00:01:26.300
-No!
[ Laughter ]

00:01:26.300 --> 00:01:29.467
-One, two, three, flip.

00:01:29.467 --> 00:01:31.801
Come on!
What's going on?!

00:01:31.801 --> 00:01:33.834
It's a landslide!
This feels rigged!

00:01:33.834 --> 00:01:35.267
All right, go for it,
go for it, go for it.

00:01:35.267 --> 00:01:37.834
-Okay.
-Yep, go.

00:01:37.834 --> 00:01:43.334
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:01:43.334 --> 00:01:45.701
Sorry.
I love you, I love you.

00:01:45.701 --> 00:01:48.300
-Oh, my gosh.
This feels so rigged right now.

00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:49.501
I am so mad.

00:01:49.501 --> 00:01:50.901
All right, come on now!

00:01:50.901 --> 00:01:52.901
Give me at least one win!

00:01:52.901 --> 00:01:56.000
One, two, three!

00:01:56.000 --> 00:01:57.200
-Oh, no!
[ Audience "Ohhs" ]

00:01:57.200 --> 00:01:59.133
-All right.

00:01:59.133 --> 00:02:01.501
-Jesus, Mary, and Joseph.
[ Laughs ]

00:02:01.501 --> 00:02:02.934
-I feel weird.
-No.

00:02:02.934 --> 00:02:04.868
-You're in a beautiful dress.
-I deserve it, I deserve it.

00:02:04.868 --> 00:02:05.934
-No.
I just -- I can't.

00:02:05.934 --> 00:02:09.067
-Sorry to Versace.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.067 --> 00:02:12.200
-Versace? I can't...
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:12.200 --> 00:02:13.701
I can't.
-Aah!

00:02:13.701 --> 00:02:15.300
Oh.
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:15.300 --> 00:02:18.734
I planned it to be really bad,
and you just did my arms?

00:02:18.734 --> 00:02:21.100
-I realize it was very nice.
I feel -- I feel odd.

00:02:21.100 --> 00:02:22.334
-I don't know if I'm
disappointed in that.

00:02:22.334 --> 00:02:25.834
-Here we go. Ready?
One, two, three.

00:02:25.834 --> 00:02:26.901
All right.
You're crushing right now.

00:02:26.901 --> 00:02:28.667
Okay, go.

00:02:28.667 --> 00:02:30.801
You did that one already!

00:02:30.801 --> 00:02:32.501
Yeah, go.

00:02:32.501 --> 00:02:34.000
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:34.000 --> 00:02:36.701
Did you do it?
All right, do it twice.

00:02:36.701 --> 00:02:38.200
Just -- God!

00:02:38.200 --> 00:02:40.400
You're gonna milk out
the whole thing?

00:02:40.400 --> 00:02:42.100
All right.
This is ridiculous.

00:02:42.100 --> 00:02:43.734
I'm getting destroyed here.

00:02:43.734 --> 00:02:45.334
Why did I agree to do this?

00:02:45.334 --> 00:02:46.734
All right, here we go.

00:02:46.734 --> 00:02:48.968
One, two, three, flip.

00:02:48.968 --> 00:02:51.000
Come on!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:02:51.000 --> 00:02:52.100
Wait.
Is that it?

00:02:52.100 --> 00:02:53.968
-This is not normally
how this happens.

00:02:53.968 --> 00:02:56.067
-We didn't get one war at all?

00:02:56.067 --> 00:02:57.501
-I kind of want to try again
and see if we get a war.

00:02:57.501 --> 00:02:59.033
-Yeah, let's go for it again.
This is good.

00:02:59.033 --> 00:03:00.601
I like this.
Whoever loses this

00:03:00.601 --> 00:03:01.934
gets the water cannon.
-Okay.

00:03:01.934 --> 00:03:03.834
-So we go one...
-Oh, shoot.

00:03:03.834 --> 00:03:07.167
-...two, three.

00:03:07.167 --> 00:03:09.000
And now this is it.
-Okay.

00:03:09.000 --> 00:03:10.434
-Thanks for coming on the show.
-[ Laughs ]

00:03:10.434 --> 00:03:11.701
-Nice to see you.
-Have me back, please.

00:03:11.701 --> 00:03:14.434
-Happy holidays.
[ Both laugh ]

00:03:14.434 --> 00:03:17.634
Congrats on the movie, and...

00:03:17.634 --> 00:03:19.167
Oh, yeah!

00:03:19.167 --> 00:03:21.801
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:21.801 --> 00:03:24.634
-Oh, my God.

00:03:24.634 --> 00:03:27.501
Just know I gave it to you.

00:03:27.501 --> 00:03:29.667
-Are you sure?
-Okay.

00:03:29.667 --> 00:03:31.434
All right, let's go.
-You're sure?

00:03:31.434 --> 00:03:33.067
-Yes!

00:03:33.067 --> 00:03:35.634
Ohh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:35.634 --> 00:03:36.834
Ohh!

00:03:36.834 --> 00:03:38.234
-Here we go.
Here, you can get me.

00:03:38.234 --> 00:03:39.334
-Oh!
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:39.334 --> 00:03:40.634
-Lindsay Lohan, everybody!

00:03:40.634 --> 00:03:41.901
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:41.901 --> 00:03:43.467
-I can't --
-Pfft!

00:03:43.467 --> 00:03:45.868
Music from the --
Watch out for The Roots!

00:03:45.868 --> 00:03:47.200
-Sorry, Quest!
-Watch out for The Roots!

00:03:47.200 --> 00:03:48.467
Sorry, Quest.

00:03:48.467 --> 00:03:49.300
Pfft!

00:03:49.300 --> 00:03:51.367
1975 are coming up!

00:03:51.367 --> 00:03:53.033
Come back!
Lindsay Lohan, everybody!

00:03:53.033 --> 00:03:54.934
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:03:54.934 --> 00:04:01.534
♪♪

00:04:01.534 --> 00:04:03.267
-♪ Yeah ♪

00:04:03.267 --> 00:04:04.300
♪ Tell 'em ♪

